// # ooboot package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for ooboot (layers/L1-kernel).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (ooboot.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of ooboot.oo.
